  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "First release. Deploy (install, update, upgrade, stage) from one source environment to any set of ticked environments or a saved environment group, managed or unmanaged, with a per-target pre-flight and a progress bar per environment. Uninstall queue: dependency-ordered deletes across environments, with a read-only pre-flight. Dependency diagnosis with an ordered, executable removal plan. Solution XML reader. Needs the System Customizer or System Administrator role.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Deploy a Dataverse solution to a saved group of environments, run every solution lifecycle operation across them, and find out exactly what is blocking a solution from being deleted. Needs the System Customizer or System Administrator role.",
